---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Governance"
  description="SensOS governance principles, RFC workflow, editorial process, and change control."
>
  <header class="page-header">
    <p class="eyebrow">Ecosystem Constitution</p>
    <h1>Governance</h1>
    <p>
      Operational rules for specifications, reviews, and compliance across the
      SensOS ecosystem. Canonical document:
      <a href="/rfc/RFC-NVS-GOV-0001">RFC-NVS-GOV-0001</a>.
    </p>
  </header>

  <section class="gov-hero panel panel-pad">
    <p class="eyebrow">Primary Specification</p>
    <h2><a href="/rfc/RFC-NVS-GOV-0001">RFC-NVS-GOV-0001</a></h2>
    <p>
      SensOS Ecosystem Master Governance Specification & Operational Framework
      (v1.4.0) — Normative Governance Specification (SSOT).
    </p>
    <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/rfc/RFC-NVS-GOV-0001">Read full specification</a>
  </section>

  <div class="gov-grid">
    <section class="panel panel-pad">
      <h2>Governance Principles</h2>
      <ol>
        <li>Specification before implementation</li>
        <li>Canonical documentation over duplicated documentation</li>
        <li>Deterministic governance over ad hoc decisions</li>
        <li>Automated verification over manual assertion</li>
        <li>Backward compatibility unless explicitly superseded</li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <section class="panel panel-pad">
      <h2>RFC Workflow</h2>
      <ol>
        <li>Proposal (PR / Draft RFC)</li>
        <li>Editorial Review</li>
        <li>Technical Review</li>
        <li>CI Validation</li>
        <li>Portal Publication</li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <section class="panel panel-pad">
      <h2>Editorial Process</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Layer 0 metadata verification</li>
        <li>RFC 2119 keyword compliance</li>
        <li>Formatting and supersession links</li>
        <li>Minimum one Editorial Board approval</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="panel panel-pad">
      <h2>Change Control</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>No production ABI change without Active/Standard RFC</li>
        <li>Temporary drift exceptions ≤ 14 days with dual approval</li>
        <li>CI-generated compliance artifacts only</li>
        <li>Public <code>/v1</code> contracts remain backward compatible unless superseded</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .gov-hero {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-5);
  }

  .gov-hero h2 {
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-2);
    font-size: 1.35rem;
  }

  .gov-hero p {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    max-width: 48rem;
  }

  .gov-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-4);
  }

  @media (min-width: 800px) {
    .gov-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }

  .gov-grid h2 {
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-3);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }

  ol,
  ul {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 1.15rem;
  }

  li {
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }
</style>
